// enricherImpl is the server-side MetadataSource capability for image-enricher.
// It is STATELESS between RPCs (arch §0.2): every output is a pure function of
// the request, so a crash loses no in-flight work (the core replays via enrich's
// per-source document copy). image-enricher attaches EXIF provenance: Match
// carries the file's absolute_path (stamped by scan) into the chain's Query;
// BuildRequest is a nop (the local EXIF "fetch" is the file read done in
// Convert); Convert invokes the system exiftool subprocess on absolute_path and
// maps the EXIF tags; Merge writes the metadata into document.sources
// ["image-enricher"] ONLY (arch §3.3). The core stamps _provenance/_view
// authoritatively (INV-namespace-write).
